14
00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:46.210
Hakuna njia ya kuunganisha naye, lakini yeye ni mmiliki wake.

15
00:05:46.210 --> 00:07:48.070
Red hatua nje.

16
00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:51.270
Idadi kubwa ya miili karibu na Phoenix

17
00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:54.770
