18
00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.490
Kutakuwa na shinikizo katika Washington

19
00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.730
kueleza jinsi hasira kama hiyo ya ajabu

20
00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:01.530
