21
00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.690
Huenda tukizungumza kuhusu waathirika wa vita vya ardhi

22
00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:08.010
au labda baadhi ya wahamiaji haramu ambao ni tied kwa fidia,

23
00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:09.470
lakini itakuwa wiki kadhaa

24
00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:23.690
kabla ya kuwa na picha wazi zaidi juu ya nani waathirika.

25
00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.610
Yeye amekuwa kuongoza timu yetu ya majibu ya kidnapping

26
00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:26.650
