32
00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.630
Kwa hiyo yeye ni thumpper.

33
00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:38.830
Leo ilikuwa siku yake ya tano ya OIS.

34
00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.150
Tano na O, si mbaya kwa ajili ya newbie.

35
00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.390
Yeye kamwe kazi kesi.

36
00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.590
Nimekuwa nikipiga milango tangu siku ya kwanza.

37
00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:45.410
Mimi tayari kama yake.

38
00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.350
Vipi kuhusu mwenzi?

39
00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.750
Je, umeona hatua?

40
00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.550
Yeye amekuwa na sisi kwa miezi 18 tu.

41
00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:50.990
Ana historia gani?

42
00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:51.990
Yeye ni mtoto sharp.

43
00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.150
