45
00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:01.030
Yeye ni kijani, lakini yeye ni nzuri.

46
00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.550
Hakuna mawakili katika treni hii.

47
00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:04.710
Tu kunipa msichana.

48
00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.390
Alifanya hivyo kulingana na kitabu, sivyo?

49
00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:22.050
Hebu tufanye hivyo.

50
00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:35.970
Kwa nini usiingie hapa, Kate?

51
00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.850
Ni jambo la ajabu leo.

52
00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.890
Hata hivyo, maofisa wawili walipoteza maisha yao.

53
00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.670
Ndiyo, bwana.

54
00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:45.970
Unajuaje kuhusu kazi ya Manuel Diaz?

55
00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:47.810
Kampuni yake, Sun Oasis,

56
00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.890
