61
00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:01.750
Yeye ni uwezekano mkubwa wa kuwa mshiriki wao wa juu katika Marekani.

62
00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:05.280
Unajua nini kuhusu ndugu yake?

63
00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.040
Sikujua alikuwa na moja.

64
00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.760
Guillermo.

65
00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:09.800
Ndugu yake anaitwa Guillermo.

66
00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.400
Je, unajua chochote kuhusu binamu yake?

67
00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.520
Sikujua alikuwa na moja ya hayo pia.

68
00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.560
Hakuna jambo lolote kati ya hayo katika faili yake.

69
00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:18.370
Binamu yake ni Fausto Alarcon.

70
00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:19.210
Hakuna anayejua.

71
00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:20.230
Yeye ni nje ya gridi.

72
00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:22.950
Yeye ni namba tatu katika Sonora Cartel.

73
00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.630
Hii si idara yangu, bwana.

74
00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.470
Kama nilivyosema, Wakala Mason hawezi kufanya kazi na dawa za kulevya.

75
00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:30.050
Yeye anaendesha timu ya majibu ya utekaji-nyara.

76
00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:30.890
