Wanaume ambao ni kweli kuwajibika kwa leo, yeah.

118
00:12:53.190 --> 00:13:09.840
Nitatoa msaada.

119
00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:15.790
Nitatoa msaada.

120
00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.980
