149
00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:33.100
Hmm?

150
00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:36.100
Makartel katika Mexico ni maalumu yako.

151
00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:37.100
- Ndiyo, ni kweli.

152
00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:43.120
