159
00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.820
Labda ni gonorrhea.

160
00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.820
Ni rangi gani?

161
00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.820
Chembe za manjano zenye madoa nyekundu.

162
00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.820
Machapisho ya damu ni nyekundu.

163
00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:30.900
Kujaribu kupata DOD kuniruhusu kuangalia katika njama hii ya kuzama Fiji.

164
00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:31.900
Fiji?

165
00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:32.900
- Ndiyo, ni kweli.

166
00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:33.900
Acha Fiji peke yake, magaidi.

167
00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.900
Bila shaka.

168
00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.900
Nadhani mwezi au mbili huko, tutaweza kufanya yote kazi nje.

169
00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.900
Kwa hiyo ni nani anayeenda huko leo?

170
00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:40.900
Marshals, DEA.

171
00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:41.900
Nilikuwa na T kutoka wewe, mtu.

172
00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:42.900
