173
00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:44.900
Inanifanya ni joto na kufifia.

174
00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:45.900
Oh, wao ni kundi crack, pia.

175
00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.900
Tu rotated nyuma kutoka Afghanistan.

176
00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:48.900
Wow! - Ni nini?

177
00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:49.900
Je, kila mtu alikuwa akiunganisha?

178
00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:51.900
AIC.

179
00:19:52.900 --> 00:20:05.750
Nzuri, nzuri, nzuri.

180
00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:13.750
Polisi wa Marekani watakutana nawe kwenye mpaka na kwenda nawe kwenye mahakama iliyoko hapa.

181
00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:18.500
Hii ni lengo la kiwango cha juu.

182
00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:26.780
Maeneo ya uwezekano mkubwa wa jaribio itakuwa katika kubadilishana na katika kuvuka mpaka wakati wa kurudi.

183
00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.780
Maofisa wa polisi wataingia.

184
00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:32.260
Kevin, Keith, unataka kusimama?

185
00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:36.700
Sasa, timu ya majibu ya marshals ni katika Laredo.

186
00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:41.700
Hivyo marafiki wetu kutoka Delta wamejitolea kuja pamoja na sisi tutasafiri na maofisa katika kubadilishana.

187
00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.700
Na hapa ni mtu wa saa.

188
00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:45.700
Je, kuja au kusubiri hapa?

189
00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.700
Tutachukua ziara pamoja nawe.

190
00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.700
Ona bunduki mbili za pop.

191
00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:50.700
Sawa, hii ni kugeuka katika hadithi ya nyota zote.

192
00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.700
Keith, unataka mkono mwingine juu ya kubadilishana?

193
00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.700
Je, wewe ni sober?

194
00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.700
Tutafanya hivyo wakati tutakapofika huko.

195
00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.700
Kuna chupa katika lori katika kesi ya mikono yako kupata shaky.

196
00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:00.700
Unajua kwamba sikuzote ningeweza kutegemea wewe, Keith.

197
00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:02.700
Sawa, tutakuandaa mara tu tutakapomaliza hapa.

198
00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:06.700
Matt, unaweza kuwa ncha ya mkuki na hatuna haja ya kuiba guy kutoka Delta.

199
00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.700
Sasa, uwe mwangalifu unapogeuka.

200
00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:11.700
Kama Federal ni risasi, itakuwa kutokea katika turnaround.

201
00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.700
