203
00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:18.700
Je, ni sawa?

204
00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:23.700
Sasa, Delta, kama unaweza kujijulisha ili kila mtu ajue ni nani wa kujificha nyuma ikiwa kitu kinaingia kwenye kipeperushi.

205
00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:28.700
Mahali pengine pa kupata risasi ni kwenye kuvuka mpaka wakati wa kurudi.

206
00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:34.700
Popote njiani, mtu yeyote asiye katika chumba hiki ni risasi wa uwezekano.

207
00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:37.700
Operesheni si kumalizika mpaka sisi kurudi hapa.

208
00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:39.700
Je, ni sawa?

209
00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:43.700
Kuwa macho, kuwa macho, na kuwa na ufahamu.

210
00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:44.700
Wewe ni vizuri?

211
