217
00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:16.900
Nilifanya kazi katika maji.

218
00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:18.900
Kwa ajili ya DEA?

219
00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:19.900
Siyo.

220
00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:22.730
