221
00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:31.420
Kwa ajili ya Mexico. Nilikuwa mwendesha mashtaka.

222
00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:37.590
Wewe si Marekani.

223
00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:38.590
Mimi kwenda ambapo mimi ni kutumwa.

224
00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:42.190
Ulitumwa kutoka wapi?

225
00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:44.600
Cartagena.

226
00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:57.680
Nadhani itakuwa na maana kwa masikio yako ya Marekani.

227
00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:11.550
Utashuku kila kitu tunachofanya.

228
00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:13.550
Jaribu hii, kuona kama inafaa.

229
